(text "SQL On/Off direct solder-wire option\nTP1: GPIO 41 (U1 pad 33); TP2: GND\nSolder-lug switch: common to TP1, selected contact to TP2\nConfigure GPIO 41 with a pull-up. SQL1 header remains optional." (at 720 235 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "44d7e3cd-f620-4149-b088-6495f4d1ce62"))





