(text "USB-powered Main Board: TFT VCC connects directly to TEENSY_3V3 (U1 pad 15).\nExternal protected 5V input and JP1 removed. C5/C6 removed to match the tested direct TFT wiring. C1/C2 rotary filters retained.\nTFT brightness at 3.3V confirmed satisfactory. Total external 3.3V load: 250 mA maximum recommended." (at 210.82 284.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "26bbccda-0956-46f1-ba2b-14a52626b2a0"))
)
